Z||000000||hyhy4u||07-05-2001||12:11 PM||||A while back i had a bad vibration when i either got off the gas or started to break, well it turns out it wasnt a motor mount or wheel bearings or anything, just a simple exhaust tip mount broke, how easy!, well now its all back to good and ready to go back on the street.||||reg||14
